      "title": "Common Data Set | Cal Lutheran Fact Book",
      "url": "https://www.callutheran.edu/about/factbook/common-data-set.html",
      "summary": "This page provides a comprehensive overview of the Common Data Set initiative at California Lutheran University, an effort aimed at enhancing the quality and accuracy of data shared in higher education, facilitating student transitions. It includes multiple academic and administrative data resources, as well as links to past Common Data Sets spanning several academic years.",
      "stored": false,
