      "year": 2026,
      "title": "Common Data Set | Cal Lutheran Fact Book",
      "url": "https://www.callutheran.edu/about/factbook/common-data-set.html",
      "summary": "The Common Data Set (CDS) initiative is a collaborative effort aimed at improving the quality and accuracy of information provided to all involved in a student's transition into higher education. It encompasses various aspects of California Lutheran University's operations, such as admissions, enrollment, faculty, and finance. The page provides access to CDS reports from the 2010-11 academic year through to a draft version for 2024-25.",
