      "title": "Cal Lutheran Fact Book",
      "url": "https://www.callutheran.edu/about/factbook/",
      "summary": "The Cal Lutheran Fact Book provides statistical information gathered for both internal and external reporting, continually expanding in content and historical depth. Accuracy is prioritized, and data requests can be made through the Office of Educational Effectiveness and Institutional Research.",
      "stored": false,
      "fetched_at": "2026-05-27T23:49:45.249184+05:30"
    },
    {
      "doc_type": "glossary",
      "title": "Common Data Set | Cal Lutheran Fact Book",
      "url": "https://www.callutheran.edu/about/factbook/common-data-set.html",
      "summary": "The Common Data Set section of the California Lutheran University Fact Book provides a collaborative data resource aimed at improving the quality and reliability of the data regarding admissions, enrollment, degrees, and more at the university. It supports the transition of students into higher education through standardized data definitions and reports, and is an important part of the university’s commitment to transparency and educational effectiveness.",
