      "url": "https://www.callutheran.edu/president/strategic-plan/",
      "summary": "California Lutheran University initiated an integrated strategic and campus planning process in Fall 2021, with implementation extending through 2027. The plan focuses on identifying top curricular, co-curricular, and workforce priorities and involves revising physical campus aspects to support these goals. The effort includes several planning groups and employs feedback from the community to ensure comprehensive development.",
